			dependencies: ["071A387593153E20"]
			description: [
				"This pack is currently very new, and I decided to make it public as early as I did to gain player feedback."
				"Every design decision in this pack has a specific reason for being the way that it is. If something feels out of place, refer to the Design Manifesto document in the Discord server. If it is not present in there, ask me about it directly, as it would be something I have yet to consider."
				"The pack is built on community feedback that allows me to better formulate ideas, &oplease &rgive me any criticism or thoughts you have."
			]
