		{
			dependencies: ["071A387593153E20"]
			description: [
				"The rod recipe in Lathes use the hard mode (1 rod 2 small dust) recipe, a la GTNH. Most \"harder\" recipe configs are enabled in general (this is subject to change)."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Vanilla ore gen is still present, on top of GT ore gen. This is to augment the early game, as plain GT making caving irrelevant is antithetical to survival Minecraft in my opinion."
				"Bedrock ore veins are enabled &8but are as of yet unused &r and will be the main method of resource generation. Probably."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Weather (rain, fire, etc.) do NOT cause machines to explode"
				"On top of this, machine explosions do NOT cause terrain damage, only delete the machine itself."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Pollution and hazards are enabled. &cPLEASE read the design doc or talk to me directly if you dont vibe with this (or the food changes)"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:iron_gear"
			id: "319A097480599D7F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "20D52FD826E6A266"
				title: "Config Changes"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["071A387593153E20"]
			description: [
				"EMI has its place in any GTM pack, this one is no different."
				"&bAutocrafting has seen an improvement through the EMI Tree Tabs addon.&r This addon allows you to sort different crafting trees into groups and craft those entire groups as if they were one tree. "
				""
				"For example, if you want to craft all the blocks needed for an Electric Blast Furnace, you can favorite the required recipes, add the individual blocks as recipe trees, and then you can group them together and adjust the number of crafts per item. The addon GUI explains the keybinds."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This replaces the usecase of the old Just Enough Calculation mod, which allowed you to encode arbitrary recipes (similar to the paper trick in AE2 patterns), which you could exploit to add recipes that gave you the directions for multiblocks and entire processing chains."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:crafting_table"
			id: "7E43A544DD6383E4"
			subtitle: "Emi Memi Imi"
